WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.729 --> 00:00:07.277
Every date that matters in one place: openings, deadlines, Study Week, and the end of term.

2
00:00:07.277 --> 00:00:18.280
Scan the term at a glance. Seneca red marks the days you hand something in; the greys are the schedule. The deadlines cluster on October 25 and December 11, and everything is due by 11:59 p.m. Eastern Time.

3
00:00:18.280 --> 00:00:25.638
Click any assignment. It opens that assignment's page so you can see what the date actually asks of you.

4
00:00:25.638 --> 00:00:36.092
Subscribe on your phone. The subscription is a live calendar feed, not a downloaded copy. Your calendar app can refresh it if the course schedule changes.

5
00:00:36.092 --> 00:00:44.249
Treat Blackboard as the official source. If anything ever differs, Blackboard and your professor's announcements win.

6
00:00:44.249 --> 00:00:46.850
Nothing here is graded.

7
00:00:46.850 --> 00:00:53.220
Where next: Put the two deadline dates into your own planner now, before they are close.
